### Set up Streamable HTTP transport with stateful sessions

Source: https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/typescript-sdk/blob/main/docs/server.md

Create a NodeStreamableHTTPServerTransport for remote servers. Use sessionIdGenerator for stateful sessions, set to undefined for stateless mode, or set enableJsonResponse: true for plain JSON responses instead of SSE streams.

```typescript
const server = new McpServer({ name: 'my-server', version: '1.0.0' });

const transport = new NodeStreamableHTTPServerTransport({
    sessionIdGenerator: () => randomUUID()
});

await server.connect(transport);
```

