### Configure Stateless Mode for NodeStreamableHTTPServerTransport in TypeScript

Source: https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/typescript-sdk/blob/main/examples/server/README.md

This configuration snippet demonstrates how to enable stateless mode for the `NodeStreamableHTTPServerTransport` by setting the `sessionIdGenerator` to `undefined`. This setup is ideal for scenarios where session state is not required or is managed externally, allowing for simpler, horizontally scalable deployments without sticky sessions.

```typescript
sessionIdGenerator: undefined;
```

